            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A glenosphere comprising: a body having a bone facing surface and an opposing articulating surface; a hood portion integral with the body and extending from a first plane associated with the bone facing surface of the body; and a plurality of channels extending from the opposing articulating surface of the body, through the body, and through the hood portion.</p>
            </abstract>
